cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Probation Bench, please cite it as below."
title: "Probation Bench: does your AI agent learn on the job?"
type: software
authors:
  - name: rupor81
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-11-09
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/rupor81/probation-bench"
abstract: >-
  A benchmark of how AI models and agents learn on the job: a long stream of office assignments in one persistent
  simulated company, managers with unwritten rules who correct the agent by mail, and a count of whether each
  corrected mistake dies out or comes back.
keywords:
  - benchmark
  - AI agents
  - continual learning
  - LLM evaluation
  - MCP
